      "created_at": "2012-10-13T09:42:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As far as I know, the Enhanced Edition is updated for Rook City :) At least,&nbsp;Rook City already uses the (H) mechanic, has art on environment cards and the nicer card quality of the Enhanced Edition. I don't know if further improvements were made when creating the enhanced edition that are not (yet) in Rook City.</p>",
